          "stableAnchor": "h-0598732050f2"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "What was already true, verified by code before any design work",
          "anchor": "what-was-already-true-verified-by-code-before-any-design-work",
          "githubAnchor": "what-was-already-true-verified-by-code-before-any-design-work",
          "stableAnchor": "h-214aac68fe00"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "A much larger design was proposed, then deliberately narrowed",
          "anchor": "a-much-larger-design-was-proposed-then-deliberately-narrowed",
          "githubAnchor": "a-much-larger-design-was-proposed-then-deliberately-narrowed",
          "stableAnchor": "h-0feb7287d9ed"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "What shipped instead — reusing an existing mechanism, not building a new one",
          "anchor": "what-shipped-instead-reusing-an-existing-mechanism-not-building-a-new-one",
          "githubAnchor": "what-shipped-instead-reusing-an-existing-mechanism-not-building-a-new-one",
          "stableAnchor": "h-f928876784bd"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "A small unrelated fix bundled in the same commit",
