          "stableAnchor": "h-b7507b53f17b"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "The full spec lives elsewhere — this doc is the narrative, not a duplicate",
          "anchor": "the-full-spec-lives-elsewhere-this-doc-is-the-narrative-not-a-duplicate",
          "githubAnchor": "the-full-spec-lives-elsewhere-this-doc-is-the-narrative-not-a-duplicate",
          "stableAnchor": "h-e9ae0eecc6a3"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "The core reframe: two axes, not one",
