      "path": "docs/knowledge/why-every-agent-task-tool-dispatch-is-enforced-through-a-pre/why-dispatch-decide-is-a-hard-hook-enforced-gate-not-a-convention.md",
      "sourceId": "src_d8ac06e0146cfad799d9",
      "sourceDigest": "f879dd29c8545691bdbe566c6297bad4bac174d6e2ddf52a3678e319308343a0",
      "blobSha": "1cafd030c88c044698ae2595a5503878f453f0a8",
      "blobSize": 26541,
      "area": "End-user authoring, index, and knowledge registry",
      "authorityStatus": "non-authority",
      "fileClass": "maintained-authority",
      "corpus": "user-knowledge",
      "switchboardSource": "scopedRoute",
      "gap": false,
      "documentType": null,
      "claimKind": "unclassified",
      "headingCount": 20,
      "unheadedBlockCount": 45,
      "mixedFileBlockCount": 0,
      "headings": [
        {
          "level": 1,
          "text": "Why `dispatch decide` is a hard, hook-enforced gate, not a convention",
          "anchor": "why-dispatch-decide-is-a-hard-hook-enforced-gate-not-a-convention",
          "githubAnchor": "why-dispatch-decide-is-a-hard-hook-enforced-gate-not-a-convention",
          "stableAnchor": "h-f7e81d93541e"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "The evidence that prose alone doesn't work",
          "anchor": "the-evidence-that-prose-alone-doesnt-work",
          "githubAnchor": "the-evidence-that-prose-alone-doesnt-work",
          "stableAnchor": "h-f3bea59a3642"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Why the hook re-runs `decide` itself instead of checking \"did the caller already call it\"",
          "anchor": "why-the-hook-re-runs-decide-itself-instead-of-checking-did-the-caller-already-call-it",
          "githubAnchor": "why-the-hook-re-runs-decide-itself-instead-of-checking-did-the-caller-already-call-it",
          "stableAnchor": "h-32e9c4e4b006"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Why `--needs-soul` had to be added rather than reusing `--work`",
          "anchor": "why---needs-soul-had-to-be-added-rather-than-reusing---work",
          "githubAnchor": "why---needs-soul-had-to-be-added-rather-than-reusing---work",
          "stableAnchor": "h-c0e6447d4376"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Why an unresolvable capacity reports `configured:false` instead of throwing",
          "anchor": "why-an-unresolvable-capacity-reports-configuredfalse-instead-of-throwing",
          "githubAnchor": "why-an-unresolvable-capacity-reports-configuredfalse-instead-of-throwing",
          "stableAnchor": "h-b0a222d3e158"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Why `resolve` was retired outright, not deprecated in place",
          "anchor": "why-resolve-was-retired-outright-not-deprecated-in-place",
          "githubAnchor": "why-resolve-was-retired-outright-not-deprecated-in-place",
          "stableAnchor": "h-b1398f58677c"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Why this item couldn't be built as a child of `tsk-in1`, or directly on an item-less branch",
          "anchor": "why-this-item-couldnt-be-built-as-a-child-of-tsk-in1-or-directly-on-an-item-less-branch",
          "githubAnchor": "why-this-item-couldnt-be-built-as-a-child-of-tsk-in1-or-directly-on-an-item-less-branch",
          "stableAnchor": "h-51dfebd5d61f"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "MCP tool access is a hand-back, not a second client",
          "anchor": "mcp-tool-access-is-a-hand-back-not-a-second-client",
          "githubAnchor": "mcp-tool-access-is-a-hand-back-not-a-second-client",
          "stableAnchor": "h-7f99ce1da6f2"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Retiring the dead `capacity.capability` field in favor of `capacities.<id>.for`",
          "anchor": "retiring-the-dead-capacitycapability-field-in-favor-of-capacitiesfor",
          "githubAnchor": "retiring-the-dead-capacitycapability-field-in-favor-of-capacitiesfor",
          "stableAnchor": "h-07aa53a5c95c"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Scope boundary with `tsk-45f`",
          "anchor": "scope-boundary-with-tsk-45f",
          "githubAnchor": "scope-boundary-with-tsk-45f",
          "stableAnchor": "h-2e4c0fb92a03"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "`execute` streams live output; `decide` never needed to",
          "anchor": "execute-streams-live-output-decide-never-needed-to",
          "githubAnchor": "execute-streams-live-output-decide-never-needed-to",
          "stableAnchor": "h-f41c4d91efa3"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Live proof: `fgos-coding-implement` really does dispatch out-of-process to `agy`",
          "anchor": "live-proof-fgos-coding-implement-really-does-dispatch-out-of-process-to-agy",
          "githubAnchor": "live-proof-fgos-coding-implement-really-does-dispatch-out-of-process-to-agy",
          "stableAnchor": "h-275ab4c5c420"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "A configured cli-spawn capacity beats a live soul — config wins, not \"I can just do it myself\"",
          "anchor": "a-configured-cli-spawn-capacity-beats-a-live-soul-config-wins-not-i-can-just-do-it-myself",
          "githubAnchor": "a-configured-cli-spawn-capacity-beats-a-live-soul-config-wins-not-i-can-just-do-it-myself",
          "stableAnchor": "h-18cd47374451"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "`capabilities.<name>` gains `prefer`/`overrides`, replacing per-purpose duplicate capacity entries",
          "anchor": "capabilities-gains-preferoverrides-replacing-per-purpose-duplicate-capacity-entries",
          "githubAnchor": "capabilities-gains-preferoverrides-replacing-per-purpose-duplicate-capacity-entries",
          "stableAnchor": "h-f5ea7e215966"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "The real gap self-review found: two independent lookups had to be unified",
          "anchor": "the-real-gap-self-review-found-two-independent-lookups-had-to-be-unified",
          "githubAnchor": "the-real-gap-self-review-found-two-independent-lookups-had-to-be-unified",
          "stableAnchor": "h-86abf3cff758"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "A real operational snag: approve cannot run from inside an isolated worktree",
          "anchor": "a-real-operational-snag-approve-cannot-run-from-inside-an-isolated-worktree",
          "githubAnchor": "a-real-operational-snag-approve-cannot-run-from-inside-an-isolated-worktree",
          "stableAnchor": "h-5a5e8ff093b2"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Scope boundary: a raw tool call mid-turn (e.g. `WebSearch`) is not a dispatch at all",
          "anchor": "scope-boundary-a-raw-tool-call-mid-turn-eg-websearch-is-not-a-dispatch-at-all",
          "githubAnchor": "scope-boundary-a-raw-tool-call-mid-turn-eg-websearch-is-not-a-dispatch-at-all",
          "stableAnchor": "h-bafeeb7413c3"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "`fgos-coding-implement`'s own prose had gone stale about its own mechanism",
          "anchor": "fgos-coding-implements-own-prose-had-gone-stale-about-its-own-mechanism",
          "githubAnchor": "fgos-coding-implements-own-prose-had-gone-stale-about-its-own-mechanism",
          "stableAnchor": "h-67aa47c05fba"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "A closing rename: \"capacity\" became \"executor\"",
          "anchor": "a-closing-rename-capacity-became-executor",
          "githubAnchor": "a-closing-rename-capacity-became-executor",
          "stableAnchor": "h-a7cbf0778fad"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Source",
          "anchor": "source",
          "githubAnchor": "source",
          "stableAnchor": "h-df707564d14b"
        }
      ],
