      "path": "docs/knowledge/why-splitting-test-files-hits-a-floor-and-why-narrowing-veri/why-splitting-test-files-hits-a-floor-and-narrowing-verify-never-helped.md",
      "sourceId": "src_f4200596ab888bec9b2a",
      "sourceDigest": "997b1643436909261e53ff5fdfe0251b8a4b671751fb069f20bd617aab26a0f0",
